{{Quote|Do you want to lose here as you did on Malastare? The loss of that communications station lost us our meager hold on that world.|General Jylia Shale, to [[Grand Moff]] [[Valco Pandion]]|<ref name="Aftermath" />}}
The [[Galactic Empire]] had a '''communications station''' located on the [[planet]] [[Malastare]]. During the [[Galactic Civil War]], the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]] destroyed the station during the [[Battle of Malastare (Galactic Civil War)|Battle of Malastare]]<ref name="Aftermath" /> after it was [[scout]]ed by [[Commander]] [[Wedge Antilles]].<ref name="Insider 160">{{InsiderCite|160|Blade Squadron: Zero Hour}}</ref> According to [[General]] [[Jylia Shale]], the destruction of the station lost the Empire its meager hold over the world.<ref name="Aftermath" />

